                            when="1927-05-18T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 18, 1927—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>224. Your 560, May 16, 5 p.m. Your telegram May 16, 5 p.m. to Yunnanfu
                        approved.<anchor n="26" xml:id="d345-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
